---
source: crates/rimz/src/cli/teams/show.rs
expression: "rendered(&report(vec![live_instance()]), None)"
---
forge
  source: /tmp/.agents/teams/forge/team.toml
  layout: planner,coder+reviewer

  @planner   claude  fable  <- leader
  signals   ci.failed → @planner
  (prompt stack: rimz teams show forge --json)

#feat-x · working · Plan (delta) (@planner)
  worktree:  /repo/worktrees/feat-x
  isolation: host · tmp /tmp
  stages:    Explore → Plan → Implement → Done
  pr:        none

  MEMBER    STATUS   ACTIVITY         CTX   COST  AGE
  @planner  running  reading show.rs  42%  $0.25   2m

Live signals
  LANE     MEMBER    NAME                                 SIGNAL     MATCH
  #feat-x  @planner  team-forge-feat-x-planner-ci-failed  ci.failed  path=/repo/feat-x
